# kind: dp-header
# description: A 15-byte host name fills the terminal field with no terminator; a 258-byte body makes the LE length 02 01 00 00, which a big-endian reader would misread.
# derivation: Template (PV-0210..PV-0263); terminal 'build-agent-015' is exactly 15 ASCII bytes and fills offsets 81..95 without a zero byte (R-DP-5, PV-0226); length 258 = 0x0102 written u32 LE (PV-0021, PV-0221) counting the body only (PV-0022); body bytes 00..FF then 00 01, arbitrary.
# expect.error: none
# expect.length: 258
